            <title>[IGNITE-7776] Check calculated values in javadoc</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7776</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We have two issue with calculated value in javadoc:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1) wrong numbers, for example:&#160;#{5 * 1024 * 102 * 1024}&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;2) overflow int type, for example:&#160;#{5 * 1024 * 1024 * 1024}&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Need to check&amp;amp;fix as many places as possible.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
